      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "Secret-leak bug fix in secretcurl: External contributor discovered and fixed an issue where secretcurl was keeping secrets out of the command line (sandbox-safe), but leaking them into curl's process argv (readable via /proc). Fixed via curl -K/stdin. Same contributor submitted 8 PRs this window covering harness bugs, a race condition, and a new run-harness for Vercel's fx CLI.",
        "variant": "body"
      }
    },
    "text-claude-plugin": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "Claude plugin integration: Run Aeon directly from Claude with /plugin install aeon@aeon. Set up an instance, edit skills, turn a chat into an automation, all without leaving Claude Code. (PRs #884, #885)",
        "variant": "body"
      }
    },
    "text-security": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "Security hardening: SHA-pinned all GitHub Actions to immutable refs, blocked codex install scripts, narrowed the secrets-injection allowlist.",
        "variant": "body"
      }
    },
    "text-governance": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "Governance improvements: Dry-run gate preventing a skill from auto-merging its own self-authored PR; structured audit log of privileged actions.",
        "variant": "body"
      }
    },
    "text-ecosystem": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "Ecosystem recognition: Listed in Pashov's curated AI-Web3-Security directory (505⭐). @Base_Insights featured @aeonframework in \"Top AI on Base gainers\" 3 times this window.",
